          %title
          %p
            Jean Bénabou (1932-2022) was a French mathematician working in
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+theory"} category theory
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Charles+Ehresmann"} Charles Ehresmann
            and received his Thèse d’État from the Université de Paris in 1966 on the topic of what are now called
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monoidal+categories"} monoidal categories
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jean_B%C3%A9nabou"} Wikipedia entry
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Francis+Borceux"}> Francis Borceux
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em JEAN BÉNABOU (1932–2022): The man and the mathematician
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cahiers"} Cahiers
                    de Topologie et Géométrie Différentielle Catégoriques
                %strong LXIII-3
                (2022) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://cahierstgdc.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/F.-BORCEUX-LXIII-3.pdf"}> pdf
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %h2#SelectedWritings Selected writings
          %p
            Introducing the notion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monoidal+categories"} monoidal categories
            (then under the name “categories with multiplication” or “multiplicative categories”):
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jean+B%C3%A9nabou"}> Jean Bénabou
                ,
                %em Catégories avec multiplication
                , C. R. Acad. Sci. Paris
                %strong 256
                (1963) 1887-1890 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/bpt6k3208j/f1965.image"}> gallica
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jean+B%C3%A9nabou"}> Jean Bénabou
                ,
                %em Algèbre élémentaire dans les catégories avec multiplication
                , C. R. Acad. Sci. Paris
                %strong 258
                (1964) 771-774 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/bpt6k40102/f817.image"}> gallica
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jean+B%C3%A9nabou"}> Jean Bénabou
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Les catégories multiplicatives
                = succeed "," do
                  %strong 27
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Benabou-CategoriesMultiplicatives.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p
            Introducing the notion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/enriched+categories"} enriched categories
            (and of
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/strict+2-categories"} strict 2-categories
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jean+B%C3%A9nabou"}> Jean Bénabou
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Catégories relatives
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/bpt6k4019v/f37.item"} gallica
            %li{:id => "Bénabou68"}
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jean+B%C3%A9nabou"}> Jean Bénabou
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Structures algébriques dans les catégories
                %strong 10
                1 (1968) 1-126 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://www.numdam.org/item/?id=CTGDC_1968__10_1_1_0"}> doi:CTGDC_1968__10_1_1_0
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/bicategories"} bicategories
            (and introducing the terminology
            = succeed "):" do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monad"} monad
          %ul
            %li
              Jean Bénabou,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Introduction to Bicategories
              %strong 47
              Springer (1967) 1-77 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.1007/BFb0074299"}> doi:10.1007/BFb0074299
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monadic+descent"} monadic descent
            via the
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Beck-Chevalley+condition"} Beck-Chevalley condition
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monadicity+theorem"} monadicity theorem
            and introducing the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/B%C3%A9nabou-Roubaud+theorem"} Bénabou-Roubaud theorem
          %ul
            %li#BenabouRoubaud70
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jean+B%C3%A9nabou"}> Jean Bénabou
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jacques+Roubaud"} Jacques Roubaud
              = succeed "," do
                %em Monades et descente
              %strong 270
              (1970) 96-98 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/bpt6k480298g/f100"}> gallica:12148/bpt6k480298g/f100
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/BenabouRoubaud-MonadesEtDescente.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
              = succeed "):" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+Heinig"} Peter Heinig
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://mathoverflow.net/q/279152"} MO:q/279152
          %p
            On
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monads"} monads
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jean+B%C3%A9nabou"}> Jean Bénabou
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Les Triples
              = succeed "," do
                %strong 26
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Benabou-LesTriples.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p
            On
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/toposes"} toposes
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jean+B%C3%A9nabou"}> Jean Bénabou
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Problèmes dans les topos
              = succeed "," do
                %strong 34
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Benabou-ProblemesDansLesTopos.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/profunctors"} profunctors
            (“
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/distributors"}> distributors
            ”, including for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/enriched+categories"} enriched
            and
            = succeed "):" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/internal+categories"} internal categories
          %ul
            %li#Benabou73
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jean+B%C3%A9nabou"}> Jean Bénabou
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Les distributeurs
                %strong 33
                (1973) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://www.entretemps.asso.fr/maths/DistributeursLouvain.pdf"}> pdf
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Benabou-LesDistributeurs.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
            %li{:id => "Bénabou00"}
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jean+B%C3%A9nabou"} Jean Bénabou
                (notes by
                = succeed ")," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Thomas+Streicher"} Thomas Streicher
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Distributors at Work
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.mathematik.tu-darmstadt.de/~streicher/FIBR/DiWo.pdf"} pdf
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Benabou-DistributorsAtWork.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p
            On
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fibered+categories"} fibered categories
          %ul
            %li{:id => "Bénabou1975"}
              %p
                Jean Bénabou,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Fibrations petites et localement petites
                %strong 281
                Série A (1975) 897-900 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/bpt6k6228235m/f171.image#"}> gallica
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li{:id => "Bénabou1985"}
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jean+B%C3%A9nabou"}> Jean Bénabou
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Fibered Categories and the Foundations of Naive Category Theory
                %strong 50
                1 (1985) 10-37 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.2307/2273784"}> doi:10.2307/2273784
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p See also:
          %ul
            %li#Streicher18
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Thomas+Streicher"}> Thomas Streicher
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Fibred Categories à la Jean Bénabou
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1801.02927"} arXiv:1801.02927
          %p
            On
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/foliated+categories"} foliated categories
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jean+B%C3%A9nabou"}> Jean Bénabou
                ,
